PE 863: Digital Digit Factorial / 数字数字阶乘

=== Digit factorials (0-9) ===
0! = 1
1! = 1
2! = 2
3! = 6
4! = 24
5! = 120
6! = 720
7! = 5040
8! = 40320
9! = 362880

=== Numbers equal to sum of digit factorials (PE 34) ===
Found: 145
Found: 40585

